  "instance_name": "yoda_character",
  "label": "Yoda Character",
  "description": "Yoda is a fictional character from the Star Wars franchise, known for his wisdom, age, and distinctive appearance (green skin, large ears, wrinkled face). His character is often associated with calm, philosophical, and sometimes sarcastic or knowing statements. In this meme, Yoda's image is used to deliver an insulting message, which is a form of 'Yoda-ism' — a play on his iconic speech patterns — but here it is twisted into a crude, abusive context. The meme relies on the audience recognizing Yoda as a well-known, respected figure to create a jarring contrast with the offensive text.",
